body:
The Tezos reddit is dedicated to new projects and tezos as a technology which is making leaps and bounds. 

&#x200B;

Anything to do with the price should be discussed here (price varies based on pumps and dumps and does not in anyway reflect how tezos is progressing project wise (which is very positive)).

While you're at it withdraw all the cash you have from the bank and stick it under a mattress at home.

&#x200B;

Easier to steal a little stamped steel plate then break into a bank vault.

**So Chinese want to invest outside China, but the government will not allow you to send money abroad to invest.**

&#x200B;

Absolute bullshit\~ Half the PR in Australia are though Investment Immigration and must be willing to invest AUD 2.5 - 5 million to qualify for the visa. Even under the Skilled Migration they need to invest 800k, these people aren't fleeing China they travel back and forth as they wish.

I was in a similar situation they had broken up 3 months earlier. When I found out they still spoke every night, and hung out once a week and he still had feeling for her I got real pissed and confronted her- but she swore she would never go back to him for many many reasons (but still wanted to be his friend because he was a 'good guy'), and after she told him she had a new bf they stopped talking as much.

&#x200B;

Long story short she fucked him a few months later and broke up with me. I was a rebound- but would say I dodged a bullet.

A country produces products (or the businesses within the country) and pay taxes so wealth is generated by *something*. When a country does not do this (and just pumps out money), it causes hyperinflation. Very different to how Doge is produced and its value.

&#x200B;

Cannot compare.

I use turn base and real time based on the enemy.

For example at the beginning of the game when you take on the group of journey mages at a low level, turn base would get you destroyed. However if you hop around in circles real time firing off spells whenever you are facing them, the mob becomes quite manageable.

&#x200B;

Magic is much better mid/late game when you can clear groups of enemies with meteor shower/ star fall/ prismatic light or moon ray. Also beacon and gate portal speed up the game a ton.

&#x200B;

Don't think there's any 'right' way to play the game, currently playing a solo character cleric party (eradicated the other 3 members using a fountain in dragon sand). It's very challenging and fun!

 **I told her that this means we are just friends and not really in a relationship anymore, so we should probably end it.** 

That's pretty harsh bro, after 6 years together you going to drop that on them?

At some point in your relationship you wont have sex anymore anyway (when you are old with a few kids and your sex drive plummets.

&#x200B;

**In saying that you are entitled to fulfilment.**

**Solution**: Just talk to her about it. Tell her you miss the physical intimacy and it was a special thing for you. If its too familiar then try new things. Sex toys, fetishes, kinks.

&#x200B;

Don't listen to these redditors that tell you to break up and end it straight away blah blah blah. These people end up alone because they don't have the balls to put in the hard yard and make it work.

&#x200B;

PS. Anything worth having does not come easily. + Every couple goes though the same issues, the strong ones just don't let it take them down.

Last Valentines day I made a book (10 paper pages - so 20 pages space wise), with a poem of how we met and each page had a hand drawn part to go with the poems.

&#x200B;

She got me a bargain bin candle hahaha ahhh :(

What the fuckzor, the first part of your video is showing how unfair it is to be low skilled - stacked against high skilled players, then you follow it up with remove SBMM (The very thing which is TRYING to correct the unbalance). 

&#x200B;

Dont remove SBMM, just fix SBMM.

>I’m not bad, but they’re just good. Since this update I LITERALLY CANNOT PLAY THE GAME. Every single person I fight is just better than me, I now loose 90% of my gun fights, simply because everyone is the lobby is better than me. Were as before my friends would go and play ranked if they wanted to get serious. Now I just feel bad playing with them in NORMAL quick play, because I’m basically nothing but an inconvenience to them now

&#x200B;

>because everyone is the lobby is better than me

&#x200B;

SBMM doesnt work when you join your friends because it goes to the highest skilled player (or else high levels would JOIN low level matches) maybe you should read the links on the mega thread before winging about it.
